[GameId "2288537761288483"]

1. e4 g6 2. d4 Nf6 {I refuse to take the Norwegian Rat seriously. I believe the line I gave in my 1. d4 repertoire blows it out of the water, and I think a simple copy and paste will work just fine.} 3. e5 Nh5 4. Be2 {[%csl Rh5] White threatens to take on h5. Black has one trick, but as long as White doesn't fall for it, they will be much better.} Ng7 {This move is incredibly sad, and it's hard to believe anyone would ever want such a position with Black after four moves. I think White can proceed along with the same plan as the mainline.} 5. f4 $16 {[%cal Gg1f3,Ge1g1] White will easily complete their development with Nf3 and O-O, leaving themselves with a lead in development and a massive space advantage.} *

