Sure, we lost a tempo to ...b5-b4, but we will regain it soon enough because the queen on a5 is misplaced, and it will likely have to lose a tempo retreating to c7 anyway.Another idea is to split the Black queenside structure with a2-a3, since b4 came a bit prematurely, and this pawn is now overextended.} *

