1. e4 d6 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nc3 e5 4. Nf3 exd4 5. Nxd4 Be7 6. Bf4 $1 {[%csl Ge5][%cal Gd1d2,Ge1c1] The best deployment for the bishop, where it both exerts influence over the center and also avoids being attacked by ...h7-h6 or ...Ng4.} O-O 7. Qd2 Nc6 8. O-O-O Nxd4 9. Qxd4 Be6 10. f3 $16 {[%cal Gg2g4,Gh2h4,Gh4h5,Gg4g5] It's a race position, but White, with the space advantage, should be faster. Think of this position as a Sicilian with the pawn on c7 instead of e7: Black's attack is comparatively slower.} *

