Z0 11. h4 {is already a big threat that needs to be respected.}) 10... Nfd5 11. Bg2 e6 12. O-O {Black will have difficulty dealing with f2-f4. They look worse to me.} (12. Nxd5 {is also not bad to take first, but I prefer the text, which maintains a bit more tension.}) *

