s straight into it.} 14. f4 $14) 14. c4 $1 {It's time to mobilize the majority.} Bc7 $6 {This one does not make a lot of sense, mainly because ...Qd6 will not be a threat as we always have Bf4 available.} 15. d5 $1 Qd6 16. Bf4 $1 {Again, this works.} Rxe2 17. Bxd6 Rxc2 18. Bxc7 $16 {Black is in big trouble in the endgame, and they cannot stop the rook from invading e8.} *

