1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 ({The main moves, by far, are} 3. Nc3 Nf6 ({,} 3... Bb4) ({and} 3... dxe4 {. But Black does have a couple of extraneous tries that you do want to be ready for.})) 3... h6 {As waiting moves go this one does not look too clever to me.} 4. Bd3 Nf6 5. e5 Nfd7 6. Nce2 $16 {[%cal Gc2c3,Gg1f3,Gf2f4] White has a dream Steinitz. h6 does absolutely nothing for Black, and c2-c3, f2-f4, and Nf3 will play itself. The tempo up is really nice.} *

