it would be if we got to keep our dark-squared bishop.})) 6... Qc7 7. h4 ({Now, I would expect} 7. h4 Ne7 {to come, transposing to the mainline with 6...Ne7 . But Black does have some other options you need to be aware of.}) 7... Nc6 {This one does not make a whole lot of sense to me.} 8. h5 Bd7 9. Nf3 ({Black really needs} 9. Nf3 h6 {now.}) 9... h6 10. Rh3 ({And here, White can certainly play} 10. Rh3 {, which transposes to one of the main lines later on, but they also have other options.}) ({For our purposes, noticing that} 10. Rh3 {exists is enough.}) *

