1 {White can sacrifice on f5 next. It is a very, very bad sign for Black that the machine insists on castling short here. It feels like they will just be begging to get checkmated.} O-O 16. Qh3 $1 {[%cal Gg2g4]} (16. Qh3 Z0 17. g4 {is coming next, and Black is about to face a vicious attack.}) *

