d.} bxc5 15. Qg4 $1 Nf5 16. Qa4 $14 {[%cal Gg1e2,Gc3c4] Black still has some problems to solve. They cannot resolve the tension on b5 too easily; they cannot castle without running into an attack, and White can look to follow up with Ne2 and c3-c4.} *

